    text: In Filipino, 'Pagod' means tired, the way you feel after a long day.
    gloss: Tired
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_word_pagod_recall
    text: Remember, 'Pagod' means tired.
    gloss: Tired
    clip: {fileID: 0}
