  - id: rachel_hint_pakinggan
    text: Pakinggan mong mabuti. Listen carefully.
    gloss: Listen carefully.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_hint_replay
    text: Press the blue button to hear the word again.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_nudge_idle
    text: Kaya mo 'yan! Go on, you can do it.
    gloss: You can do it!
    clip: {fileID: 0}
